 For all the soldiers who lost their lives in the civil war? No! Everything she does in this life is for the sake of avoiding the guillotine! \"F-For me, this should be a piece of cake!\" Thus the useless, cowardly, self-serving princess brings about miracle after miracle in her great struggle to save herself in this altered-history fantasy.\n\n\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)"],"ja":["ティアムーン帝国物語～断頭台から始まる、姫の転生逆転ストーリー～",""]},"kodikRevisions":{"serial-54599":"2024-07-01T20:29:05Z","serial-54412":"2023-12-23T17:28:17Z","serial-54516":"2023-12-27T05:08:20Z"},"kodikIds":["serial-54599","serial-54412","serial-54516"],"relatedMalIds":[],"rating":7.2,"availableEpisodeCount":12}]}